## 13.2 Scheduled backup reminders

Implement an in-app backup reminder.

Default schedule:
- Every day.
- 5:00 PM.
- Africa/Accra timezone.

Allow the administrator to:
- Change the reminder time.
- Change reminder frequency.
- Disable the reminder.

When the reminder becomes due while the application is open, display:

"Your daily business backup is due. Would you like to back up your business records now?"

