1. Back Up Now.
2. Remind Me Later.
3. Dismiss.

If the reminder becomes due while the application is closed, display the overdue reminder the next time the application opens.

Important: An ordinary browser application cannot guarantee an alert while the browser and computer are closed. Only implement operating-system notifications if the selected runtime supports them and they have been tested.

